From: P90 native Linux port
Subject: [PATCH] netfilter: restore omitted xt_hl implementation

Lenovo enables and lists net/netfilter/xt_hl.o but omitted its source file.
Restore it verbatim from Linux stable tag v3.10.20:
https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/stable/linux.git/plain/net/netfilter/xt_hl.c?h=v3.10.20

The added file is identical to that upstream source. Its SHA-256 is recorded in
the generated artifact manifest after the build.
